===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*trewd-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|трудъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*trudъ}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*trewd-}}, whence also {{cog|en|threat}}.

===Pronunciation===
