* {{audio|ru|Ru-труд.ogg}}
* {{homophones|ru|трут}}
* {{rhymes|ru|ut|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b|adj=трудово́й}}

# {{lb|ru|usually|_|uncountable}} [[work]], [[labor]]/[[labour]]
