#: {{uxi|ru|собра́ние '''трудо́в''' Да́рвина|Darwin's collected '''works'''}}
# {{lb|ru|singular only}} [[shop]], [[handicrafts]] {{gl|a school class teaching basic vocational skills and working with one's hands}}

